    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d128">

                <pb facs="0262" n="1726" xml:id="pg1726"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">690D.91/2–1351: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in India</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Henderson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Delhi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-02-13T12:00:00+05:30">February 13,
                            1951—noon.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2063. 1. In spite probably unfavorable Pakistani reaction we still hope Nimitz
                    can be relieved his responsibilities re Kashmir. He, or almost any other US
                    citizen prominence and integrity not known be opposed to present US foreign
                    policies would be greatly handicapped.</p>
                <p>2. Bunche might be exception, since general impression prevails among Indians he
                    not likely have sympathy for Moslem point view and because India’s consistent
                    campaign against racial discrimination somewhat pro-Indian.</p>
                <p>3. Members UK HICOM here agree privately with
                    paragraph 1 above.</p>
                <p>Repeated Karachi 69.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henderson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
